 studio"><div class="studio-film  studio-film--paused studio-film--poster"><div class="studio-film__screen" role="group" aria-label="Why hire EdiCut — narrated introduction" aria-describedby="_R_ikj5_ _R_ikj5H1_"><div class="studio-film__copy"><span class="studio-film__brand neo-section-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-film" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 3v18"></path><path d="M3 7.5h4"></path><path d="M3 12h18"></path><path d="M3 16.5h4"></path><path d="M17 3v18"></path><path d="M17 7.5h4"></path><path d="M17 16.5h4"></path></svg>Why EdiCut</span><div class="studio-film__story"><div class="studio-film__titles"><p class="studio-film__title studio-film__title--poster studio-film__copy-layer" aria-hidden="false" data-active="true" data-layout="true" style="--copy-opacity:1;--copy-y:0px">More creating.<br/>Less managing.</p></div><div class="studio-film__captions"><p id="_R_ikj5_" class="studio-film__description studio-film__copy-layer" aria-hidden="false" data-active="true" data-layout="true" style="--copy-opacity:1;--copy-y:0px">A dedicated editor. A project manager. One dashboard for every edit. Meet the studio behind your next video.</p></div></div></div><div class="studio-film__media"><div class="studio-film__artwork" data-scene="0" data-cue="0" data-transition="false"><div class="studio-film__artwork-layer" data-layer="poster" data-active="true" style="--film-time:10;--layer-opacity:1;--layer-x:0px;--layer-scale:1"><svg class="offer-artwork offer-artwork--desktop" viewBox="0 0 600 420" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" style="--offer-card-fill:url(#offer-surface-_R_b6ikj5_)"><defs><linearGradient id="offer-surface-_R_b6ikj5_" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#f8fafc"></stop><stop offset="1" stop-color="#e9eef