"><circle r="27" fill="#dae8e1"></circle><image x="-27" y="-27" width="54" height="54" href="/artwork/why-hire-us/manager.svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet"></image></g><text x="79" y="35" class="offer-label">Your project manager</text><text x="79" y="55" class="offer-small">Keeps everything on track</text><path d="M80 72l5 5 11-12" stroke="#28715b" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g></g><g class="offer-motion offer-motion--draw" style="--motion-start:2.4;--motion-duration:1.1s"><path d="M82 103c9-39 48-53 98-40" stroke="#c91d37" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" pathLength="1"></path><path d="m170 55 10 8-12 4" stroke="#c91d37" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" pathLength="1"></path></g></svg><svg class="offer-artwork offer-artwork--mobile" viewBox="0 0 320 280" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="4" y="4" width="312" height="272" rx="26" fill="#e9eff3" stroke="#ffffff"></rect><text x="160" y="34" text-anchor="middle" fill="#344657" font-size="20" font-weight="650" font-family="inherit">Made for your channel</text><g><rect x="18" y="48" width="284" height="138" rx="18" fill="#e5edf2" stroke="#d5e0e7"></rect><g><defs><clipPath id="recording-scene-_R_par6ikj5_"><rect x="18" y="48" width="284" height="138" rx="18"></rect></clipPath></defs><image x="18" y="48" width="284" height="138" href="/artwork/why-hire-us/creator-recording-scene-b93b36d3.svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" clip-path="url(#recording-scene-_R_par6ikj5_)"></image></g><rect x="69" y="150" width="182" height="28" rx="8" fill="#17202a"></rect><text x="160" y="170" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffffff" font-size="17" font-weight="650" font-family="inherit">Your story, well told</text></g><g class="offer-motion offer-motion--reveal" style="--motion-start:0.65;--motion-duration:0.65s"><g><g><circle cx="48" cy="226" r="22" fill="#f0dde1"></circle><image x="26" y="204" width="44" height="44" href="/artwork/why-hire-us/editor.svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet"></image></g><text x="78" y="222" text-anchor="start" fill="#344657" font-size="18" font-weight="650" font-family="inherit">Editor</text><text x="78" y="244" text-anchor="start" fill="#526779" font-size="16" font-weight="500" font-family="inherit">Your style</text></g></g><g class="offer-motion offer-motion--reveal" style="--motion-start:4.96;--motion-duration:0.65s"><g><g><circle cx="188" cy="226" r="22" fill="#e0ece6"></circle><image x="166" y="204" width="44" height="44" href="/artwork/why-hire-us/manager.svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet"></image></g><text x="218" y="222" text-anchor="start" fill="#344657" font-size="18" font-weight="650" font-family="inherit">Manager</text><text x="218" y="244" text-anchor="start" fill="#526779" font-size="16" font-weight="500" font-family="inherit">On track</text></g></g></svg></div></div><div class="studio-film__controls"><button type="button" class="studio-film__watch neo-button neo-button--primary" data-play-prompt="false" aria-label="Play"><span class="studio-film__play-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z"></path></svg></span><span class="studio-film__watch-label" aria-hidden="true"><span class="studio-film__watch-label-text">Play</span></span></button><button type="button" class="studio-film__sound neo-button" aria-label="Mute film audio" aria-pressed="false" title="Mute sound"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-volume2 lucide-volume-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 4.702a.705.705 0 0 0-1.203-.498L6.413 7.587A1.4 1.4 0 0 1 5.416 8H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2.416a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 .997.413l3.383 3.384A.705.705 0 0 0 11 19.298z"></path><path d="M16 9a5 5 0 0 1 0 6"></path><path d="M19.364 18.364a9 9 0 0 0 0-12.728"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="studio-film__actions"><a class="studio-button neo-button neo-button--primary" href="/pricing" data-discover="true">Find your editing plan <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><p id="_R_ikj5H1_" class="sr-only">At EdiCut, you get a dedicated editor who understands your style, and a project manager who keeps your videos on track. We handle storytelling, captions, color, and sound, with studio review before your draft reaches you. Your dashboard keeps everything in one place. Start a project, share your brief and footage, and track progress. Communicate with your team, leave feedback on edits, and download your finished videos. Choose a single video or a monthly plan that fits your channel. EdiCut. You create. We handle the edit.</p><audio src="/audio/why-hire-us/edicut-why-hire-us-mix-f3907247.wav" preload="none"></audio></div><div class="studio-intro"><div><p class="studio-kicker neo-section-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users-round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 21a8 8 0 0 0-16 0"></path><circle cx="10" cy="8" r="5"></circle><path d="M22 20c0-3.37-2-6.5-4-8a5 5 0 0 0-.45-8.3"></path></svg>Your team</p><h1>You create.<br/>We handle the edit.</h1></div><div class="studio-intro__copy"><p>A dedicated editor who gets your vision. A whole studio keeping it on track. Make better videos without making post-production your full-time job.</p></div></div><ul class="studio-proof" aria-label="What comes with the studio"><li class="neo-card"><span class="studio-proof__icon neo-icon-badge"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg></span><div><strong>48-hour</strong><span>First-cut target</span></div></li><li class="neo-card"><span class="studio-proof__icon neo-icon-badge"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users-round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 21a8 8 0 0 0-16 0"></path><circle cx="10" cy="8" r="5"></circle><path d="M22 20c0-3.37-2-6.5-4-8a5 5 0 0 0-.45-8.3"></path></svg></span><div><strong>Your editor</strong><span>With a full team behind them</span></div></li><li class="neo-card"><span class="studio-proof__icon neo-icon-badge"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-briefcase-business" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 12h.01"></path><path d="M16 6V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2"></path><path d="M22 13a18.15 18.15 0 0 1-20 0"></path><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="6" rx="2"></rect></svg></span><div><strong>Your manager</strong><span>Dedicated to your projects</span></div></li><li class="neo-card"><span class="studio-proof__icon neo-icon-badge"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><div><strong>Clear pricing</strong><span>Know your scope from day one</span></div></li></ul></section><section class="studio-benefits studio-container" aria-labelledby="studio-benefits-title"><div class="studio-section-heading"><h2 id="studio-benefits-title">Personal attention.<br/>Studio-level support.</h2><p>Keep the creative connection of a dedicated editor, with the people and process to make it dependable.</p></div><div class="studio-benefits__grid"><article class="studio-benefit neo-surface group"><div class="studio-benefit__artwork"><svg viewBox="0 0 320 220" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="160" cy="100" r="84" class="why-art-halo"></circle><path d="M160 119v23H79v21m81-21h81v21" class="why-art-connector"></path><circle cx="160" cy="142" r="4" class="why-art-accent"></circle><g class="why-art-raised"><circle cx="160" cy="76" r="49" class="why-art-surface"></circle><circle cx="160" cy="76" r="39" class="why-art-inset"></circle><path d="M132 104c0-20 56-20 56 0" class="why-art-accent"></path><path d="M152 83h16v14c-6 5-10 5-16 0V83Z" fill="#e5bda6"></path><ellipse cx="160" cy="66" rx="17" ry="21" fill="#f0d3bf"></ellipse><path d="M143 64c-4-23 39-28 35 3-5-1-8-7-9-13-5 8-17 9-26 10Z" class="why-art-ink"></path><path d="M139 65v14m42-14v14m-1-1c0 8-4 11-13 11" class="why-art-line"></path><rect x="135" y="66" width="7" height="13" rx="3" class="why-art-ink"></rect><rect x="178" y="66" width="7" height="13" rx="3" class="why-art-ink"></rect></g><g class="why-art-raised"><rect x="28" y="156" width="104" height="54" rx="16" class="why-art-surface"></rect><circle cx="53" cy="183" r="16" class="why-art-inset"></circle><circle cx="53" cy="178" r="5" class="why-art-slate"></circle><path d="M44 192c0-12 18-12 18 0" class="why-art-slate"></path><rect x="76" y="175" width="37" height="5" rx="2.5" class="why-art-slate"></rect><rect x="76" y="186" width="25" height="4" rx="2" class="why-art-inset"></rect><path d="m111 190 3 3 6-7" class="why-art-check"></path></g><g class="why-art-raised"><rect x="188" y="156" width="104" height="54" rx="16" class="why-art-surface"></rect><circle cx="213" cy="183" r="16" class="why-art-inset"></circle><circle cx="213" cy="178" r="5" class="why-art-slate"></circle><path d="M204 192c0-12 18-12 18 0" class="why-art-slate"></path><rect x="236" y="175" width="37" height="5" rx="2.5" class="why-art-slate"></rect><rect x="236" y="186" width="25" height="4" rx="2" class="why-art-inset"></rect><path d="m271 190 3 3 6-7" class="why-art-check"></path></g><g class="why-art-raised" transform="rotate(-9 69 63)"><rect x="42" y="33" width="51" height="61" rx="12" class="why-art-surface"></rect><path d="M54 48h26m-26 10h26m-26 10h16" class="why-art-connector"></path><path d="m56 79 4 4 9-9" class="why-art-check"></path></g><circle cx="239" cy="63" r="19" class="why-art-surface why-art-raised"></circle><path d="m231 63 5 5 11-12" class="why-art-check"></path></svg></div><h3>An editor who knows your channel.</h3><p>Your dedicated editor learns your pacing, references, and personality. A shared style guide keeps your videos consistent, even when a backup editor steps in.</p><span class="studio-benefit__note neo-icon-badge"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users-round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 21a8 8 0 0 0-16 0"></path><circle cx="10" cy="8" r="5"></circle><path d="M22 20c0-3.37-2-6.5-4-8a5 5 0 0 0-.45-8.3"></path></svg>Dedicated editor + replacement coverage</span></article><article class="studio-benefit neo-surface group"><div class="studio-benefit__artwork"><svg viewBox="0 0 320 220" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="160" cy="104" r="86" class="why-art-halo"></circle><g class="why-art-raised"><rect x="39" y="35" width="242" height="157" rx="20" class="why-art-surface"></rect><rect x="51" y="47" width="218" height="104" rx="11" class="why-art-inset"></rect><circle cx="225" cy="74" r="13" fill="#b7c8d7"></circle><path d="m59 138 53-64 45 55 31-33 65 42H59Z" fill="#b2c2cf"></path><path d="m90 138 49-41 32 41H90Z" fill="#91a7b9"></path><rect x="130" y="79" width="60" height="43" rx="14" class="why-art-accent"></rect><path d="m155 91 14 10-14 10V91Z" fill="white"></path><path d="M62 58h18m-18 0v14m196-14h-18m18 0v14M62 139h18m-18 0v-14m196 14h-18m18 0v-14" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path><rect x="55" y="162" width="67" height="15" rx="4" class="why-art-slate"></rect><rect x="126" y="162" width="44" height="15" rx="4" class="why-art-accent"></rect><rect x="174" y="162" width="91" height="15" rx="4" class="why-art-inset"></rect><path d="M144 156v27" class="why-art-line"></path></g><g class="why-art-raised" transform="rotate(-10 45 112)"><rect x="18" y="82" width="48" height="67" rx="13" class="why-art-surface"></rect><circle cx="33" cy="99" r="6" class="why-art-accent"></circle><circle cx="51" cy="99" r="6" class="why-art-ink"></circle><circle cx="33" cy="119" r="6" class="why-art-slate"></circle><circle cx="51" cy="119" r="6" class="why-art-inset"></circle><path d="M30 136h24" class="why-art-connector"></path></g><circle cx="268" cy="43" r="25" class="why-art-accent why-art-raised"></circle><path d="m257 43 7 7 15-16" stroke="white" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><h3>A second pair of expert eyes.</h3><p>Your creative director checks the story, sound, captions, and brand details before a draft reaches you. Spend your review time on the creative decisions.</p><span class="studio-benefit__note neo-icon-badge"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Two stages of internal review</span></article><article class="studio-benefit neo-surface group"><div class="studio-benefit__artwork"><svg viewBox="0 0 320 220" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="160" cy="110" r="86" class="why-art-halo"></circle><g class="why-art-raised" transform="rotate(-7 116 115)"><rect x="35" y="47" width="171" height="143" rx="20" class="why-art-surface"></rect><path d="M35 68c0-12 8-21 20-21h131c12 0 20 9 20 21v13H35V68Z" fill="#f3dfe2"></path><path d="M72 38v20m99-20v20" class="why-art-line"></path><rect x="56" y="99" width="19" height="17" rx="5" class="why-art-inset"></rect><rect x="88" y="99" width="19" height="17" rx="5" class="why-art-inset"></rect><rect x="120" y="99" width="19" height="17" rx="5" class="why-art-inset"></rect><rect x="152" y="99" width="19" height="17" rx="5" class="why-art-inset"></rect><rect x="56" y="127" width="19" height="17" rx="5" class="why-art-inset"></rect><rect x="88" y="127" width="19" height="17" rx="5" class="why-art-inset"></rect><rect x="120" y="127" width="19" height="17" rx="5" class="why-art-inset"></rect><rect x="152" y="127" width="19" height="17" rx="5" class="why-art-inset"></rect><rect x="56" y="155" width="19" height="17" rx="5" class="why-art-inset"></rect><rect x="88" y="155" width="19" height="17" rx="5" class="why-art-inset"></rect><rect x="120" y="155" width="19" height="17" rx="5" class="why-art-inset"></rect><rect x="152" y="155" width="19" height="17" rx="5" class="why-art-inset"></rect><path d="m59 107 4 4 8-9m20 33 4 4 8-9m20 5 4 4 8-9m-8 31 4 4 8-9" class="why-art-check"></path></g><g class="why-art-raised" transform="rotate(8 223 114)"><rect x="158" y="59" width="117" height="78" rx="13" class="why-art-surface"></rect><rect x="166" y="67" width="101" height="62" rx="7" class="why-art-slate"></rect><path d="m208 83 21 14-21 14V83Z" fill="white"></path></g><g class="why-art-raised" transform="rotate(-6 224 146)"><rect x="161" y="103" width="124" height="83" rx="14" class="why-art-surface"></rect><rect x="169" y="111" width="108" height="67" rx="8" class="why-art-inset"></rect><path d="m170 165 33-38 30 38h-63Z" fill="#b2c2cf"></path><rect x="243" y="111" width="34" height="67" rx="8" class="why-art-accent"></rect><path d="m205 132 20 13-20 13v-26Z" fill="white"></path></g><circle cx="257" cy="181" r="20" class="why-art-surface why-art-raised"></circle><path d="m248 181 5 5 12-13" class="why-art-check"></path><path d="M250 43h30m0 0-10-10m10 10-10 10" class="why-art-check"></path></svg></div><h3>An upload schedule you can keep.</h3><p>A clear first-cut timeline and one place for your footage and feedback keep production moving. Add Shorts, podcast edits, or thumbnails as your channel grows.</p><span class="studio-benefit__note neo-icon-badge"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>48-hour first-cut target</span></article></div></section><section class="studio-comparison" aria-labelledby="studio-comparison-title"><div class="studio-container"><div class="studio-section-heading"><div><p class="studio-kicker neo-section-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-columns2 lucide-columns-2" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect><path d="M12 3v18"></path></svg>Studio advantage</p><h2 id="studio-comparison-title">More support.<br/>Less to manage.</h2></div><p>Great editing is only part of the job. Here’s how the studio model supports everything around it.</p></div><div class="studio-comparison__table-wrap neo-surface"><table class="studio-comparison__table"><caption class="studio-sr-only">Working with a solo freelancer compared with the EdiCut studio</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col"><span class="studio-sr-only">Service</span></th><th scope="col">Solo freelancer<span>An individual approach</span></th><th scope="col"><span class="studio-comparison__brand">EdiCut studio <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></span><span>A team in your corner</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Your editor</th><td>One person, with limited backup</td><td><span class="studio-comparison__answer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>A dedicated editor, backed by a full team</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">First cut</th><td>Depends on individual availability</td><td><span class="studio-comparison__answer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>A 48-hour target from your confirmed brief</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Quality control</th><td>You review every detail yourself</td><td><span class="studio-comparison__answer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Editor review + creative director sign-off</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Project management</th><td>Files and feedback across different chats</td><td><span class="studio-comparison__answer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>One workspace for briefs, files, and feedback</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pricing</th><td>Hourly rates and changing estimates</td><td><span class="studio-comparison__answer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Clear packages, revision rounds, and add-ons</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Room to grow</th><td>Limited by one editor&#x27;s capacity</td><td><span class="studio-comparison__answer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Long-form, Shorts, podcasts, and thumbnails</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="studio-comparison__mobile"><dl><div><dt>Your editor</dt><dd><span class="studio-comparison__option-label">Solo freelancer</span><span>One person, with limited backup</span></dd><dd><span class="studio-comparison__option-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>EdiCut studio</span><span>A dedicated editor, backed by a full team</span></dd></div><div><dt>First cut</dt><dd><span class="studio-comparison__option-label">Solo freelancer</span><span>Depends on individual availability</span></dd><dd><span class="studio-comparison__option-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>EdiCut studio</span><span>A 48-hour target from your confirmed brief</span></dd></div><div><dt>Quality control</dt><dd><span class="studio-comparison__option-label">Solo freelancer</span><span>You review every detail yourself</span></dd><dd><span class="studio-comparison__option-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>EdiCut studio</span><span>Editor review + creative director sign-off</span></dd></div><div><dt>Project management</dt><dd><span class="studio-comparison__option-label">Solo freelancer</span><span>Files and feedback across different chats</span></dd><dd><span class="studio-comparison__option-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>EdiCut studio</span><span>One workspace for briefs, files, and feedback</span></dd></div><div><dt>Pricing</dt><dd><span class="studio-comparison__option-label">Solo freelancer</span><span>Hourly rates and changing estimates</span></dd><dd><span class="studio-comparison__option-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>EdiCut studio</span><span>Clear packages, revision rounds, and add-ons</span></dd></div><div><dt>Room to grow</dt><dd><span class="studio-comparison__option-label">Solo freelancer</span><span>Limited by one editor&#x27;s capacity</span></dd><dd><span class="studio-comparison__option-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>EdiCut studio</span><span>Long-form, Shorts, podcasts, and thumbnails</span></dd></div></dl></div><p class="studio-comparison__footnote">Your first-cut timeline starts when your brief and footage are confirmed. Your chosen package defines deliverables and revision rounds.</p></div></section><section class="site-faq " aria-labelledby="_R_8kj5_"><div class="site-faq__intro"><p class="site-faq__kicker neo-section-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg>FAQ</p><h2 class="site-faq__title" id="_R_8kj5_">Good questions.<br/>Straight answers.</h2><p class="site-faq__description">Get to know your team, your edits, and how it all works.</p></div><div class="site-faq__list"><article class="site-faq__item neo-card" data-open="false"><h3><button type="button" id="_R_mokj5_-question" class="site-faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_mokj5_-answer"><span>Will I work with the same editor?</span><span class="site-faq__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_mokj5_-answer" class="site-faq__answer" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_mokj5_-question" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="site-faq__answer-inner"><p>Yes. You have a primary editor who learns your channel&#x27;s rhythm, humor, and pacing. Your shared style guide also helps our backup editors maintain the same approach when coverage is needed.</p></div></div></article><article class="site-faq__item neo-card" data-open="false"><h3><button type="button" id="_R_16okj5_-question" class="site-faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_16okj5_-answer"><span>What if my editor is unavailable?</span><span class="site-faq__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_16okj5_-answer" class="site-faq__answer" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_16okj5_-question" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="site-faq__answer-inner"><p>A studio editor or creative lead can step in using your channel&#x27;s style guide, timeline templates, and assets. Your project continues with the studio team behind it.</p></div></div></article><article class="site-faq__item neo-card" data-open="false"><h3><button type="button" id="_R_1mokj5_-question" class="site-faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_1mokj5_-answer"><span>Can I start with just one video?</span><span class="site-faq__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_1mokj5_-answer" class="site-faq__answer" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_1mokj5_-question" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="site-faq__answer-inner"><p>Yes. Choose a single-video package to experience the editing and review process before deciding on a monthly plan. You can find both options on our pricing page.</p></div></div></article><article class="site-faq__item neo-card" data-open="false"><h3><button type="button" id="_R_26okj5_-question" class="site-faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_26okj5_-answer"><span>How do you learn my channel&#x27;s style?</span><span class="site-faq__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_26okj5_-answer" class="site-faq__answer" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_26okj5_-question" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="site-faq__answer-inner"><p>During onboarding, we collect your favorite videos, pacing references, typography, colors, and audio preferences. Your editor works from that profile, and the creative director checks each draft against it.</p></div></div></article><article class="site-faq__item neo-card" data-open="false"><h3><button type="button" id="_R_2mokj5_-question" class="site-faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_2mokj5_-answer"><span>How do revisions work?</span><span class="site-faq__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_2mokj5_-answer" class="site-faq__answer" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_2mokj5_-question" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="site-faq__answer-inner"><p>Each package includes revision rounds. Leave timestamped feedback in your workspace or linked video player, and your editor works through the notes. Minor adjustments typically take around 24 hours.</p></div></div></article></div></section><section class="studio-closing studio-container" aria-labelledby="studio-closing-title"><div class="studio-closing__panel neo-surface group"><div><h2 id="studio-closing-title">Your next video.<br/>Our next great edit.</h2><p>Start with one video, or find a monthly plan that fits your publishing rhythm.</p></div><div class="studio-closing__actions"><a class="studio-button neo-button neo-button--primary" href="/pricing" data-discover="true">See plans and pricing <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="studio-button neo-button neo-button--secondary" href="/contact" data-discover="true">Let’s talk about your channel</a><span>Single videos and monthly plans available.</span></div></div></section></main><footer data-analytics-region="footer" class="neo-footer relative overflow-hidden border-t px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="neo-footer__inner mx-auto max-w-7xl pb-5 pt-8 sm:pb-7 sm:pt-12 md:pb-10 md:pt-14"><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-[minmax(18rem,1.45fr)_minmax(9rem,1fr)_minmax(11rem,1fr)] md:items-stretch"><section class="neo-footer__lead flex flex-col justify-between p-5 md:p-6"><div><h2 class="type-card-title neo-footer-ink">Plan your next video</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-md text-sm leading-5 neo-footer-muted sm:text-[15px]">Tell us your video format, footage, and deadline. We will help you choose an editing package.</p></div><a class="neo-button neo-button--dark neo-button--compact mt-6 w-fit" href="/contact" data-discover="true">Discuss your project</a></section><section class="neo-footer__group"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left text-sm font-bold neo-footer-ink md:pointer-events-none md:border-b md:border-[var(--neo-line)] md:pb-3">Explore<span class="footer-mobile-chevron material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] transition-transform duration-200">expand_more</span></button><nav class="grid gap-2 overflow-hidden text-sm transition-[max-height,opacity,padding] duration-200 max-h-0 opacity-0 md:mt-3 md:max-h-none md:overflow-visible md:pb-0 md:opacity-100" aria-label="Explore"><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/why-hire-us" data-discover="true">Why Hire Us</a><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/services" data-discover="true">Services</a><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/pricing" data-discover="true">Pricing</a><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/portfolio" data-discover="true">Portfolio</a></nav></section><section class="neo-footer__group"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left text-sm font-bold neo-footer-ink md:pointer-events-none md:border-b md:border-[var(--neo-line)] md:pb-3">Support<span class="footer-mobile-chevron material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] transition-transform duration-200">expand_more</span></button><nav class="grid gap-2 overflow-hidden text-sm transition-[max-height,opacity,padding] duration-200 max-h-0 opacity-0 md:mt-3 md:max-h-none md:overflow-visible md:pb-0 md:opacity-100" aria-label="Support"><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/contact" data-discover="true">Contact</a><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/faq" data-discover="true">FAQ</a><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/privacy" data-discover="true">Privacy</a><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/terms" data-discover="true">Terms</a></nav></section></div><section class="neo-footer__bottom mt-5 md:mt-6"><div class="neo-footer__utility-rail"><div class="neo-footer__social"><div class="flex gap-3" aria-label="Social media icons"><span role="img" aria-label="Facebook" class="neo-footer-social-icon neo-footer-ink"><svg width="25" height="25" viewBox="0 0 25 25" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M25 12.5C25 5.6 19.4 0 12.5 0C5.6 0 0 5.6 0 12.5C0 18.55 4.3 23.5875 10 24.75V16.25H7.5V12.5H10V9.375C10 6.9625 11.9625 5 14.375 5H17.5V8.75H15C14.3125 8.75 13.75 9.3125 13.75 10V12.5H17.5V16.25H13.75V24.9375C20.0625 24.3125 25 18.9875 25 12.5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span role="img" aria-label="Instagram" class="neo-footer-social-icon neo-footer-ink"><svg width="25" height="25" viewBox="0 0 25 25" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M13.7857 0C15.192 0.00375 15.9057 0.01125 16.522 0.02875L16.7645 0.0375C17.0445 0.0475 17.3207 0.0599999 17.6545 0.0749999C18.9845 0.1375 19.892 0.3475 20.6882 0.65625C21.5132 0.97375 22.2082 1.40375 22.9032 2.0975C23.5388 2.72237 24.0307 3.47824 24.3445 4.3125C24.6532 5.10875 24.8632 6.01625 24.9257 7.3475C24.9407 7.68 24.9532 7.95625 24.9632 8.2375L24.9707 8.48C24.9895 9.095 24.997 9.80875 24.9995 11.215L25.0007 12.1475V13.785C25.0038 14.6968 24.